{
    "title": "Screw Home: ASMR Clean",
    "description": "Screw Home is a casual and fun brain-challenging game. Unlock the screw puzzles and decorate the charming room. Start challenging your brain and show your strategy.\r\nHow to play?\r\nThe game goal here is simple and easy to understand. You just need to unscrew the screws and put them in the toolbox of the same color. Unscrew all the screws in the level to complete the challenge! After passing the level, you can decorate your room, choose furniture according to your preferences, and build your dream house!\r\nGame features:\r\n- Fun and interesting level design. The screws in the level are carefully designed. As the level increases, different types of challenges and many styles of screws will appear, making the level full of fun!\r\n- Hundreds of level content. The levels in the game are constantly updated, so don't worry about not having new content to play.\r\n- Freely designed decoration. You can decorate the room according to your favorite style. Bedrooms, swimming pools, living rooms, different rooms are all designed by you freely. Choose chairs, beds, table lamps, floors, and build your dream house.\r\n- Powerful level props. What should I do if I encounter a difficult level? A variety of props to help you easily beat the level. Use props to smash obstacles, add holes, and add toolboxes. No need to worry about the most difficult levels.\r\n- Rich activities and rewards. Various activities are launched from time to time to enrich the gameplay. Participate in activities to win rewards, and you will be the master of this game.\r\nScrew Home is a game that perfectly combines puzzle solving and decoration. Here you can experience unforgettable and interesting levels, and you can also build your dream house as you like. Challenge the screw level puzzles, think carefully about each step, and you will dig out more happiness!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Screw Home is a casual and fun brain-challenging game. Unlock the screw puzzles and decorate the charming room. Start challenging your brain and show your strategy.<br>How to play?<br>The game goal here is simple and easy to understand. You just need to unscrew the screws and put them in the toolbox of the same color. Unscrew all the screws in the level to complete the challenge! After passing the level, you can decorate your room, choose furniture according to your preferences, and build your dream house!<br>Game features:<br>- Fun and interesting level design. The screws in the level are carefully designed. As the level increases, different types of challenges and many styles of screws will appear, making the level full of fun!<br>- Hundreds of level content. The levels in the game are constantly updated, so don&#39;t worry about not having new content to play.<br>- Freely designed decoration. You can decorate the room according to your favorite style. Bedrooms, swimming pools, living rooms, different rooms are all designed by you freely. Choose chairs, beds, table lamps, floors, and build your dream house.<br>- Powerful level props. What should I do if I encounter a difficult level? A variety of props to help you easily beat the level. Use props to smash obstacles, add holes, and add toolboxes. No need to worry about the most difficult levels.<br>- Rich activities and rewards. Various activities are launched from time to time to enrich the gameplay. Participate in activities to win rewards, and you will be the master of this game.<br>Screw Home is a game that perfectly combines puzzle solving and decoration. Here you can experience unforgettable and interesting levels, and you can also build your dream house as you like. Challenge the screw level puzzles, think carefully about each step, and you will dig out more happiness!",
    "summary": "Solve ASMR Screw Home puzzles, join pin puzzle and decorating challenges!",
